    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> —</p><p>Constant work with mechanics, logic, and rationality have honed in the engineer an unconscious ability to coldly rationalize and overcome any mental strife. Once per day, the engineer can reroll any saving throw against a mind-affecting effect. The reroll must be used before the engineer knows the result of failing the saving throw. This trick can be selected multiple times, each time allowing an additional reroll per day.</p>",
